  "description": "## WELCOME TO THE\n\n# 💰 The Bankers Guild 💰\n\n##### EST. March 7, 2024\n\n##### Founded by Joanropo\n\n ### ════════════════════════\n\n**You enter the building...**\n\nA bevy of chatter bubbles up from the different pockets of conversation in this bustling guild. Friendly chuckles and good-natured comments pass between the bankers. An accountant makes sense of numbers by moving beads on an abacus. A bag of golden coins is spilled on an exquisite wooden table, as payment for an agreement, as a price for a future. More riches are forged here than anywhere else in this lively city.\n\n ### ════════════════════════\n\n## 🏆 Achievements 🏆\n\n* #### Level 100 on Agust 20, 2024\n* #### Top 1 on September 16, 2024\n* #### 1st Guild to complete a 25/25 member raid on September 30, 2024\n\n ### ════════════════════════\n\n## 🛡️ Requirements 🛡️\n- ##### Play Daily\n- ##### Be in Discord\n\n### ════════════════════════\n\n## 🚫 Kick Conditions 🚫\n\n- #### Inactivity for more than 3 days.\n\n*NOTE: Let officers and/or the guild leader know in advance about any situation that may affect your performance. If you don&#039;t communicate these issues, it will be grounds to be kicked out of the guild. \n\n### ════════════════════════\n\n## ⚔️ ***JOIN NOW!*** ⚔️\n\n### Our **MANDATORY** Discord Server\n\n### https://discord.gg/DcxtMcXCdG",
